/looper
.code-analysis/

# CI checks the parity oracle (narthur/skills, for internal/record's parity gate) out
# here. It must be IGNORED, not merely untracked: `git status --porcelain` lists
# untracked paths, so the mutation-score step's clean-tree guard aborted on it.
.parity-oracle/
# CI writes each oracle step's verbose test output to <pkg>.log at the root so the next
# step can assert the parity gate did not skip. Ignored, not merely untracked: the
# mutation-score step runs afterwards and its clean-tree guard counts untracked paths
# ("refusing to run: 1 uncommitted change(s)"). One pattern rather than a name per step,
# because push.log and then learn.log were each missed when their step was added.
/*.log
